# {{ name }}

Fullstack Rust app generated by [rise](https://github.com/EryyynIT/rise):

- `backend/` — {{ backend.backend }} API server (`{{ name }}-backend`)
- `frontend/` — Yew single-page app compiled to WASM (`{{ name }}-frontend`)

## Prerequisites

```sh
rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown
cargo install trunk
```

`rise doctor` checks these for you.
{%- if 'grpc' in backend.features %}

The backend's gRPC API (port 50051) builds with protoc — the Protocol
Buffers compiler: https://grpc.io/docs/protoc-installation/
{%- endif %}

## Development
{%- if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] or 'auth' in backend.features %}

```sh
cp backend/.env.example .env  # {% if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] %}set DATABASE_URL{% if 'auth' in backend.features %} and JWT_SECRET{% endif %}{% else %}set JWT_SECRET{% endif %} — the backend refuses to start without it
```
{%- endif %}

Two terminals from the workspace root:

```sh
cargo run -p {{ name }}-backend
```

```sh
cd frontend && trunk serve
```

The SPA is on http://localhost:8080; trunk proxies `/api` to the backend
on http://localhost:3000 (see `frontend/Trunk.toml`).

## Production

```sh
cd frontend && trunk build --release
cargo run --release -p {{ name }}-backend
```

The backend serves the API and the built `frontend/dist` bundle on
http://localhost:3000.
{%- if backend.deployment == 'docker' %}

## Docker

```sh
docker build -t {{ name }} .
```
{%- if backend.database in ['sqlite', 'sled'] %}

```sh
docker run -p 3000:3000{{ " -p 50051:50051" if 'grpc' in backend.features }}{% if 'auth' in backend.features %} -e JWT_SECRET=<a-long-random-string>{% endif %} {{ name }}
```
{%- else %}

```sh
docker compose up --build  # the app together with its Postgres service
```
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
